[2026-03-16T03:47:16.367Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JM39oAMC7VehULuxz9H7MX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All subtasks are complete. Here's a summary of the accessibility improvements made to the Host Dashboard page:\n\n**HostDashboard.tsx**: Replaced outer `<div>` with `<main>`, added `role=\"tablist\"` with `aria-label`, `role=\"tab\"` with `aria-selected`/`aria-controls` on tab buttons, and `role=\"tabpanel\"` with `aria-labelledby` on tab panels.\n\n**StatsOverview.tsx**: Changed wrapper to `<section>` with `aria-label`, added `aria-hidden` on decorative icons, added `aria-live=\"polite\"` loading announcement.\n\n**ListingsTab.tsx**: Added `aria-hidden` to all decorative icons (MapPin, Star, Edit, Power, Plus, Home), added `role=\"dialog\"`/`aria-modal`/`aria-labelledby` to deactivate confirmation dialog, implemented focus trap and Escape key support, added loading state announcement.\n\n**BookingsTab.tsx**: Added `aria-pressed` to filter buttons with `role=\"group\"`, added `aria-label` to bookings table, added `aria-hidden` to decorative icons, added `role=\"dialog\"`/`aria-modal`/`aria-labelledby` to cancel booking dialog with focus trap and Escape support, added loading state announcement.\n\n**AddListingForm.tsx**: Added `role=\"dialog\"`/`aria-modal`/`aria-labelledby` to main modal and discard dialog, implemented focus trap with Escape key support, added `aria-label` to close button, added `aria-live` to step indicator, added `aria-haspopup`/`aria-expanded` to property type dropdown, added `htmlFor`/`aria-required`/`aria-describedby` to form fields, added `role=\"alert\"` to error messages, added `aria-label` to increment/decrement and remove photo buttons.\n\n<DONE>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":372,"cache_read_input_tokens":82918,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":372,"ephemeral_1h_input_toke